# The-OSI-MODEL

the open system interconnection (OSI) Model is a framework used to understand 
how diffrent protocols networking protocols interact. 
It has 7 layers:

1. APPLICATION
2. PRESSENTATION
3. SESSION
4. TRANSPORT
5. NETWORK
6. DATA-LINK
7. PHYSICAL

